---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="粒子語言核心 - MRLiou">
  <main>
    <a class="back" href="/">&larr; 返回首頁</a>
    <h1>🧬 粒子語言核心</h1>
    <p class="lead">Particle Language Core System — 邏輯種子運算與函數鏈執行框架。</p>
    <section>
      <h2>核心概念</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>邏輯種子 (Logic Seed)</strong>：最小可執行語義單元，可組合成函數鏈。</li>
        <li><strong>粒子類型</strong>：Seed / Flow / Container / Transform / Gate / Storage / Persona / Bridge / Identity / Signal / Memory。</li>
        <li><strong>SimHash 指紋</strong>：64-bit 內容指紋，用於近重複偵測與去重。</li>
        <li><strong>函數鏈</strong>：粒子以有向鏈組合，支援折疊 (collapse) 與重建。</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>運算邊界</h2>
      <p>邊緣層負責驗證、鏡像與轉譯；權威狀態與簽章由 DL580 母體 Runtime 持有。</p>
    </section>
    <p class="sig">origin_signature: MrLiouWord</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
  main { margin: auto; padding: 1rem; width: 800px; max-width: calc(100% - 2rem); color: white; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; }
  h1 { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 0.5em; }
  .lead { color: rgb(var(--accent-light)); }
  section { margin: 1.5rem 0; padding: 1.25rem; background: rgba(var(--accent-dark), 40%); border-radius: 8px; }
  .back { color: rgb(var(--accent-light)); text-decoration: none; }
  .sig { color: #888; font-size: 0.85em; margin-top: 2rem; }
</style>
